# citysdk_tourism_poi_query
**Type:** tool
**Module:** packages.haive-tools.src.haive.tools.toolkits.citydsk_toolkit
**Class:** StructuredTool

## Description
Retrieve Points of Interest from the CitySDK Tourism API using a bounding box or city filter.

## Schema
```json
{
  "description": "Input schema for querying Points of Interest from the CitySDK Tourism API.\n\nArgs:\n    bbox: Bounding box coordinates to filter POIs geographically\n    city: City name to filter POIs by location",
  "properties": {
    "bbox": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "Bounding box (e.g., '24.9384,60.1695,24.9500,60.1750') to filter POIs geographically.",
      "title": "Bbox"
    },
    "city": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "Optional city to filter POIs.",
      "title": "City"
    }
  },
  "title": "CitySDKTourismPOIInput",
  "type": "object"
}
```

## Usage as Tool
**Tool Name:** `citysdk_tourism_poi_query`
**Description:** Retrieve Points of Interest from the CitySDK Tourism API using a bounding box or city filter.

